From 4b86a010873e7aa975be9e46b029967e9eee3371 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Mausberg <samuelmausberg@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:50:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add capture-only head-input dumps for real-head replay

Behind SGLANG_HEAD_CAPTURE_DIR, LogitsProcessor stashes the exact tensor it
passes to the LM head, and the EAGLE/NEXTN verify, DFlash verify and plain
decode paths append one pickled record per forward step with the aligned
draft and target head inputs (BF16 bits), draft tokens, the engine's target
argmax and accept lengths. Requires --disable-cuda-graph and
--disable-overlap-schedule; measurement only.
